# WP-FAR-8: spatially loaded HLODs in the packaged game - the cook packs the HLOD hierarchy into HLOD cells
# (WorldCells.hpp THE HLOD CELLS; UE UHLODLayer::bIsSpatiallyLoaded) and the game streams them (BeginCooked ->
# BeginHLODCells, the second residency with the HLOD gate). World: Scenes/WP_Protocol as SCOPE-FAR-HLOD.scn plays it:
# HLOD_Main (Main grid) spatially loaded - CellSize 51200 (512 m), LoadingRange 102400 (1024 m) - with ParentLayer
# HLOD_Main_Far always loaded (the tops). Source: the Plane 9000002 (WP-SRC-ALTITUDE.scn), its shape raised 2 km by
# ShapeOffset.y, the Player 9000001 off. Before WP-FAR-8 the package step failed: "HLOD layer 'HLOD_Main' is spatially
# loaded (CellSize, LoadingRange), and a cooked world does not stream HLOD cells yet".
# Package Game bundles build/Bin/<PackageConfig>/Runtime (~/.desertengine/editor.json): Debug, so --shot works.
# After PASS, outside the editor (the scenario drives the editor only; Runtime has no camera flag - its view is the
# player's, so for [far8_packaged_far] save camera 1003 2 km up in a copy, as WP23 did with WP23_Regions):
#   WorldCook --source Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce ... --verify: "verify HLODs : N HLOD record(s) back from M
#                 HLOD unit(s) of the hierarchy the index states", exit 0
#   [far8_packaged_far]  <package>/Runtime --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce --shot far8_packaged_far.png
#                 --shot-frames 600: the whole city as HLOD_Main_Far blocks + landscape/foliage HLOD, no hole, no double;
#                 log "[WorldPartition] 'WP_Protocol': K cooked HLOD(s) in U HLOD unit(s) (16 HLOD cell(s))", no
#                 "HLOD_Main(x,z) loaded" while the source is 2 km up
#   [far8_packaged_near] the same package after ShapeOffset 0,0,0 + Save + Package Game: Main cells around the plane real
#                 ("G0_L0_..." loaded only after "HLOD HLOD_Main(x,z) loaded" above it - the gate), HLOD_Main beyond,
#                 HLOD_Main_Far past 1 km; the log has no cook refusal
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.ShapeOffset 0,195000,0
Дано set 1003 CameraData.Far 800000
Дано run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Build "Package Game"
Тогда far8_pak пакет собран без отказа кука; в логе «[Package] world '…WP_Protocol…' cooked into N file(s)» (N включает файлы H<grid>_<x>_<z>.dwcell 16 ячеек HLOD_Main и HLOD_H… вершин HLOD_Main_Far); нет «does not stream HLOD cells»
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 3
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,200000,-150000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,0.75
Когда advance 2
Тогда far8_packaged_far (тот же мир в Play, эталон для кадра пакета) с 2 км весь город виден как HLOD (HLOD_Main_Far + HLOD ландшафта/листвы), без дыр и двойных блоков
Когда run Action "Stop"
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.ShapeOffset 0,0,0
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 3
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,40000,-40000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,1
Когда advance 2
Тогда far8_packaged_near (эталон для кадра пакета) у земли: вокруг самолёта настоящие ячейки Main, дальше HLOD_Main, за 1 км HLOD_Main_Far; ни дыр, ни двойных
Когда run Action "Stop"
